  "candidate": {
    "status": "answered",
    "answer": "Quoted lead times, according to the supplier's conditions, are defined as working days from written order acceptance, not calendar days from a user query. The supplier operates Monday to Friday, excluding holidays (holiday calendar not provided), and lead times are estimates, not guaranteed arrival dates. The lead-time value in the catalogue represents an estimated number of working days for delivery after written order acceptance, excluding transit time. These values are not promises of specific arrival dates and do not include any expedited delivery options.",
